<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\川辺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Then come to the Arata settlement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Women like you, <STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, are exactly what the Arata settlement is looking for. 
{PAUSE ""}
Your dreams and passion, <STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, would surely be a help to the Arata settlement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You make it sound so easy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That would mean I throw away my home, throw away my family―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and bring shame on Father and the others."</STYLE><PG>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
So that's what it is..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2"> said that and sat down again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, you have things you hold dear. 
{PAUSE ""}
For their sake, you have to give up your dream."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... right..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Things I hold dear―as </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2"> says, family and home are important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But what I was thinking of was that I cannot go against the custom of this age and this place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That is a little different from protecting the things I hold dear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2">, it seems, simply cannot understand this custom.</STYLE><PG>
"But I understand how you feel, too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Having to be with someone you don't want. 
{PAUSE ""}
I understand that feeling very well."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What could you possibly understand about me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\hydrangea.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I do understand!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Understand what! </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="4">　For the rest of my life, I will have to...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I clenched my fists and lashed out at </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1">. Thank you for your time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll be going home now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, please wait! I...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, please take care."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I cut off </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2">'s words and left the river behind.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\夜道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I ran and ran through the darkness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I was truly glad that it was night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because no one I passed would see my crying face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I ran along the river toward home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because I did not want anyone I passed to hear my crying voice.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">As the sound of the river faded, regret came over me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That I had parted from him the way I did.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2">'s values, which I had rejected.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That I had refused the invitation to the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I could never see </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2"> again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuh... ngh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I tripped on a stone, and my hands and face hit the ground.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My pretty kimono―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and the makeup I had spent so long on, all of it was ruined.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After all, this is what suits me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That is what comes of trying to dress above my station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And then―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Raindrops fell onto my back, which faced the sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Far from washing off the dirt all over me, they only dirtied me more.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\夜道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">If I had not left </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2">'s side, would he have put those vestments over me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And then, sheltering from the rain somewhere again―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">When my thoughts got that far, my feet moved forward on their own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2"> had come after me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I did not want </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="2"> to see me like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I did not want to be seen looking so miserable.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At last, I clearly realized what I was feeling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">regret.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My life will no longer go the way I wish.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My way of living will be forced on me, in line with custom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In that case, better to go somewhere that truly needs me...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Surely many women in the past have gone through the same thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I am not the only woman to be pitied.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So my wishes are surely selfish and willful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I know that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I know, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">How to escape being forced like that―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the way to do it had been right in front of me until just now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I did not act.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because I did not act, it was only ever a pipe dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because I acted the way I did, it became a pipe dream.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨2早い.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I wiped my tears and started walking along the river again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haha... so I had been crying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The drops on my </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ほお">cheeks</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> that I had taken for rain had a sad warmth.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It doesn't... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">matter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It doesn't matter anymore.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The responsibility is mine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I am the one who kicked that choice away, so it is my fault.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I may dream, but I will never again regret.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
